        "title": "Gemini 3.5 flash-lite replaces 3.1 in helper agents",
        "summary": "Lightweight helper agents (basher, browser-use, file-lister, file-picker-max, researcher-web, researcher-docs) switched from `GEMINI_3_1_FLASH_LITE_MODEL_ID` to `GEMINI_3_5_FLASH_LITE_MODEL_ID`. `FREE_MODE_AGENT_MODELS` retains 3.1 in a shared `GEMINI_HELPER_MODELS` set to prevent 403 errors for pinned CLI/Desktop clients that haven't upgraded yet. Scope covers `agents/*.ts` definitions, `common/src/constants/free-agents.ts`, and `common/src/constants/gemini.ts`. 3.5 flash-lite costs $0.30/$2.50 per M tokens vs 3.1's $0.25/$1.50, making this a deliberate cost increase for high-volume subagent calls.",
